<title>CHINA: Shanghai Sanmao 1996 net down 49 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Sanmao 1996 net down 49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In millions of yuan, unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		   276.540	  vs	232.320</p>
<p> Net profit		  10.240	  vs	 20.250</p>
<p> Net assets per share     2.801 yuan   vs	  2.748 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.103 yuan   vs	  0.203 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Sanmao Textile Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: The results were published in a company statement on Sunday. The numbers are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
<p>Under international accounting standards, net profit was 5.591 million yuan in 1996, compared with 8.442 million in 1995.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors have proposed a one-for-10 bonus share issue, pending approval at a shareholders meeting on May 28. ($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
